<mxCell id="c28" value="&amp;mdash; Association: actor participates in use case&lt;br&gt;&amp;#8594; &amp;lt;&amp;lt;include&amp;gt;&amp;gt; (dashed, open arrow): base use case always requires the target use case (e.g. mandatory login)&lt;br&gt;&amp;#8594; &amp;lt;&amp;lt;extend&amp;gt;&amp;gt; (dashed, open arrow): source use case optionally extends the target use case&#x27;s behaviour&lt;br&gt;Box labelled &#x27;Budget Planning Application&#x27;: system boundary &amp;mdash; actors sit outside, use cases sit inside" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="614" width="830" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram>
